  <RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Affected.CountPrefix>{0} betroffen: {1}</RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Affected.CountPrefix>
  <RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Affected.AndMore> und {0} weitere</RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Affected.AndMore>

